(15, 'privacy_policy', '<h3 data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"416\"><strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"416\">These Terms and Conditions May Change</strong></h3><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\">\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"771\" style=\"\"><font color=\"#424242\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Elevate\n reserves the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at \nany time without prior notice. Your continued use of elevate.com (or any\n associated subdomains) following any such change constitutes your \nagreement to be bound by the updated Terms and Conditions. We encourage \nyou to review these Terms regularly whenever you use our platform</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">.</span></font></p></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">No\n content from this platform may be copied, reproduced, modified, posted,\n transmitted, or distributed in any form without prior written consent \nfrom Elevate Marketplace. All rights reserved.</font></span></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"svg 1.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\"><br></font></span></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-br