s with the carrier for any lost, damaged, or delayed shipments.</p><br><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><br></h4>', NULL, '2025-10-13 05:51:14');
