(19, 'refund_policy', '<h3 data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"416\"><strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"416\">These Terms and Conditions May Change</strong></h3><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\">\n<p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"771\" style=\"\"><font color=\"#424242\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Elevate\n reserves the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at \nany time without prior notice. Your continued use of elevate.com (or any\n associated subdomains) following any such change constitutes your \nagreement to be bound by the updated Terms and Conditions. We encourage \nyou to review these Terms regularly whenever you use our platform</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">.</span></font></p></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">No\n content from this platform may be copied, reproduced, modified, posted,\n transmitted, or distributed in any form without prior written consent \nfrom Elevate Marketplace. All rights reserved.</font></span></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"svg 1.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\"><br></font></span></h4><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"771\" style=\"\"><strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"809\" style=\"font-size: 2rem; font-family: sans-serif;\">Limitations of Liability<br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">Elevate\n Marketplace shall not be responsible or liable for any damages to your \ncomputer, mobile device, software, or other property resulting from your\n access to, use of, or browsing of this website, or from downloading any\n material from the platform.</font></span></p><p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"771\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\"><br></font></span></p></h4><h2 data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2024\"><strong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2024\">Copyright and Trademark</strong></h2><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2237\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">Unless\n otherwise specified, all materials on this website—including text, \nimages, graphics, videos, designs, and software—are the property of \nElevate Marketplace and are protected by copyright and trademark laws.</font></span></p><p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"771\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">\n\n</font></span></p><p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2430\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">No\n content from this platform may be copied, reproduced, modified, posted,\n transmitted, or distributed in any form without prior written consent \nfrom Elevate Marketplace. All rights reserved.</font></span></p></h4><h2 data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3253\"><strong data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3253\">Shipping Limitations</strong></h2><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><p data-start=\"3254\" data-end=\"3467\"><font color=\"#424242\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Items purchased from Elevate Marketplace are shipped by individual sellers based on their specific shipping policies.</span><br data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3374\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\nOnce an order is handed over to the carrier, responsibility and risk of loss transfer to you.</span></font></p><p data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2430\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">\n\n</font></span></p><p data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3568\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">You are responsible for filing claims with the carrier for any lost, damaged, or delayed shipments.</font></span></p></h4><h2 data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4846\"><strong data-start=\"4817\" data-end=\"4846\">Electronic Communications</strong></h2><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><p data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3568\">\n</p><p data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"5076\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><font color=\"#424242\">By\n using this platform or sending us emails, you consent to receive \ncommunication electronically. All agreements, notices, disclosures, and \nmessages provided electronically fulfill any legal requirement for \nwritten communication.</font></span></p></h4><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\">Third Party sites and social</span></b></p><p><br></p><p>Items purchased from Elevate Marketplace are shipped by individual sellers based on their specific shipping policies. Once an order is handed over to the carrier, responsibility and risk of loss transfer to you.You are responsible for filing claims with the carrier for any lost, damaged, or delayed shipments.</p><br><h4 style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(134, 134, 134, 0.12); font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 26px; font-family: &quot;Albert Sans&quot;, serif; line-height: 28px; word-break: break-word;\"><br></h4>', NULL, '2025-10-13 05:51:14');
