(1, 1, 'Convoc Clothing', 'convoc-clothing', '105/107, 50 Feet Rd, Laxmi Nagar', 'Tiruppur', 'Tamilnadu', '641607', 'India', '+91 9384209763', '11.1168284', '77.3191656', 'Convoc was born out of a simple yet profound idea – to provide high-quality promotional T-shirts at the best price. It all began with a passion for clothing and a desire to help businesses and brands express themselves uniquely and effectively. In a world where first impressions matter, we recognized the power of corporate clothing as a means to make a lasting impact.', 'uploads/store/thumbnail/-1784023411.jpg', NULL, '2026-07-14 00:16:58', '2026-07-21 05:17:01', '899', '0');
